 "card_notes": [
  {
   "text": "<sup>1</sup> Nanbeige4.3-33B is evaluated with <code>preserve_thinking=true</code> in the chat template.<br>",
   "source": "Nanbeige/Nanbeige4.3-33B README.md:L64"
  },
  {
   "text": "The tokenizer provides a configurable chat template for reasoning and tool-use scenarios:",
   "source": "Nanbeige/Nanbeige4.3-33B README.md:L90"
  },
  {
   "text": "- `enable_thinking` controls whether the model generates reasoning for the current response. It is enabled by default; set it to `False` for non-thinking mode.",
   "source": "Nanbeige/Nanbeige4.3-33B README.md:L92"
  },
  {
   "text": "The model supports a context length of up to 524,288 tokens (512K).",
   "source": "Nanbeige/Nanbeige4.3-33B README.md:L96"
  },
  {
   "text": "> **UNCENSORED** = refusal-removed GGUF build of **[Nanbeige/Nanbeige4.3-33B](https://huggingface.co/Nanbeige/Nanbeige4.3-33B)**. Three quants in one place: **Q6_K (25.3 GB)**, **Q4_K_M (18.7 GB)**, **IQ2_XXS (8.7 GB)**. All ship with a fresh matching importance matrix (imatrix) over 1M tokens of mi",
   "source": "dealignai/Nanbeige4.3-33B-UNCENSORED-GGUF README.md:L43"
  },
  {
   "text": "Enable thinking mode via `chat_template_kwargs`:",
   "source": "dealignai/Nanbeige4.3-33B-UNCENSORED-GGUF README.md:L204"
  },
  {
   "text": "- Thinking: binary on/off via `chat_template_kwargs`",
   "source": "dealignai/Nanbeige4.3-33B-UNCENSORED-GGUF README.md:L218"
  }
 ],
